{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ComeCloser Camera 是一款專為 iPhone 設計的相機應用，能夠同時啟動廣角、超廣角與長焦鏡頭，實時捕捉深度與動態數據，讓照片呈現人眼所見的空間層次感。適用於追求真實影像質素、喜愛攝影的用戶。目前限時免費，原價 US $1.99。</p>\n\n<h2>多鏡頭同時捕捉深度空間</h2>\n<p>ComeCloser Camera 利用 iPhone 的深度感應器，讓你設定前景範圍，輕鬆控制主體與背景的距離感，無需調整焦距或光圈。所有處理均在裝置端完成，透過 Apple Metal 框架，無需上傳雲端，保證私隱與速度。拍攝的照片能保留真實的透視與深度，告別單一鏡頭的變形與壓縮，讓每一張照片都還原現場的空間氛圍。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-897-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-898-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-899-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-900-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-901-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-902-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ComeCloser Camera</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T18:37:54.957116+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}